It includes:
- Stockfish (https://stockfishchess.org), GPL-3.0, downloaded at build time.
- Chess pieces based on the RhosGFX set (CC0 1.0), recoloured.
- Piece sets: Classic (Colin M.L. Burnett, GPL-2.0+), Merida (Armando Hernandez Marroquin, GPL-2.0+),
  Chessnut (Alexis Luengas, Apache 2.0), Mono (Maxime Chupin, GPL-3.0+), Spatial (Maurizio Monge, MIT),
  Warm (RhosGFX, CC0 1.0).
- Opening data from lichess-org/chess-openings, CC0 1.0 (licenses/CC0-chess-openings.txt).
- Puzzles (app/src/main/assets/puzzles.dat, gzipped) from the Lichess puzzle database, database.lichess.org, CC0 1.0 (licenses/CC0-chess-openings.txt has the CC0 text).
- Montserrat and Roboto fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1 (licenses/).
- Material icon glyphs (star, thumb up, check, book, close), Apache 2.0, by Google.
